Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:33.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last night, the FAA was forced to ground all aircraft, leaving thousands stranded...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:36.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,...when electronic failures and mysterious power outages...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:40.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,...crippled the western United States. But the big story today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,...the much-anticipated wedding of fantastic couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:48.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Reed Richards and Susan Storm will take place this Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:53.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. Bizarre anomalies...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:57.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,...are occurring all over the world, defying every law of physics...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:01.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and all the media care about is what china pattern we picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:06.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you pick? The blue ones with them little flowers? I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:07.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:11.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's happening again, isn't it? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:14.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. We're not postponing anything, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:19.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,This will be the wedding you dreamed of. I won't let anything get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:24.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not even the mysterious transformation of matter at the subatomic level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:28.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the most romantic thing you've ever said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:31.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which is really pathetic, when you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:35.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Richards, I'm very sorry, but we're overbooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:39.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We do have seats available in coach. - Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:40.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Smile! - Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:45.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let me get one more. - That should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:53.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:08.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:23.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if we get an endorsement from an airline? Get us a private jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:26.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we have enough endorsement deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:32.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's funny. Seriously, Reed, it could help subsidize your little inventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:35.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, thanks. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:38.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Consider it. Talk to you later. - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't fly coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope it rains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:02.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,The snowfall came with no warning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and covered the pyramids in 2 inches of snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:08.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,In Japan, some suggest the solidification of the bay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:11.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,...was due to underwater volcanic activity...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,...though no such activity has been reported in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Scientists have ruled out global warming...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:20.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,...as the cause of the climatic events being reported around the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:23.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,With scientists unable to explain the events...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:27.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,...some are wondering if the hand of God is at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:30.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,In other news, Reed Richards and Susan Storm's wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:32.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,...has Manhattan all abuzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:36.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guest list includes many of New York's power elite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:39.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:43.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,The city's charging us for three squad cars they say we destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:47.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,...during that armored-car robbery. I only remember two cars getting thrown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:56.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. I'm putting it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a fitting in half an hour. The musicians after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:06.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't picked out the place settings or the flowers. There's too much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:10.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. Between the two of us, we'll get it all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what were you doing when I walked in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:15.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Inputting my to-do list. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:18.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Scout's honor. - Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,New uniforms showed up. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think there's no way we're wearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:29.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you have against capitalism?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just a little hobby of mine. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:39.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would it make a good toy, or is it something science-y?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,A little of both.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:48.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm both impressed and disgusted at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:50.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sue says I'm addicted to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:52.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wonder why she'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:08:01.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep it quiet, but I've cross-referenced and analyzed the global disturbances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:05.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're caused by cosmic radiation, not unlike the kind which gave us our powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:08.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:13.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, I have a very important wedding issue we need to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:17.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your bachelor party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Seriously, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:24.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,John. Focus-testing showed Johnny skewed a little young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:29.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously, Johnny, no bachelor party. It's just not my kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:35.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then do it for Ben. It means a lot to the big guy. You'll break his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:37.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,He does have some sort of rocklike heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have too much to do before the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:42.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think Sue might have a problem with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:45.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what Sue would have a problem with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,If somebody told her you were investigating...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:50.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,...global disturbances and cosmic radiation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:57.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,...instead of focusing on the wedding, like you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A bachelor party could be fun. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,But no exotic dancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:10:00.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is it? - I don't know anybody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would have invited your friends, but you don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:05.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:11.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're not exotic dancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're just hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:21.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're Mr. Fantastic, aren't you? That's so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:26.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:29.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll need a pitcher with the biggest handle you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:31.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good evening, and welcome to the Baxter...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:55.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could I help you? No, you can't use that elev...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ms. Storm will be with your shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:08.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Roberta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:18.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're here to see Dr. Richards. - He's not here. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. You can take me to see Dr. Richards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.31,0:11:24.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:34.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:40.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,When the universe began, it was no bigger than a marble. Then, bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,It exploded. And in a trillionth of a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:47.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,...it expanded exponentially into what became the universe we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:53.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Candy. That means a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:56.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love this song. Wanna dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:58.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, I don't. - Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Honestly. - Come on, you'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:02.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to embarrass you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just loosen up. Have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:18.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:24.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:36.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Guy really knows how to loosen up. - You're not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:13.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,For him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:26.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think it might be clobbering time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:29.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue. What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:34.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,General Hager.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:36.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's talk somewhere private.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:40.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless you need to do Jell-O shots off someone's stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:44.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was explaining to the girls about how the big bang led to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:49.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,This was Johnny's idea. I just went along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:53.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,How does Reed know the general?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:57.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,A few years back, the guy was pushing a new missile-defense system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed testified that the technology wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here on direct orders from the Joint Chiefs of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:07.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Personally, I don't like sharing sensitive information with a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:11.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Especially one who enjoys the public spotlight so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.61,0:14:14.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Always a pleasure to see you too, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:20.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,As you may know, there've been unusual occurrences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:24.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Officially, we've downplayed their significance, but we're concerned...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:29.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,...these anomalies might pose a credible threat to our national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:33.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,These were taken by one of our spy satellites three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:39.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is it? - We hoped Dr. Richards could tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:43.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I've never seen anything like it. Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:49.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would say that it was a meteor, but the trail's all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:51.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's giving off its own energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:57.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,These have been appearing in remote areas throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:01.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Field personnel estimate its diameter to be 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:06.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,To find out what this is about, we need a way to locate and intercept that object.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:10.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,A sensor could be tied into the Baxter Building's satellite grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:13.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can pinpoint the location of the object.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:18.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good. You'll build the sensor for us... - I'm afraid I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:26.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting married this Saturday. I just don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:32.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Richards, your country needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:35.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call Professor Jeff Wagner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's head of the Physics Department at Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:40.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I expected more, Richards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:43.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,John Storm, Fantastic Four Incorporated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:03.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ever done any modeling? - Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:06.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You got an amazing complexion. - Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:13.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, and you just walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:15.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was definitely still talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:19.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you just turned down a science project.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:23.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,They can build a sensor without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:26.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,The most important thing right now is our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:28.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No postponements. No interruptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:29.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:33.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,And, look, about what you saw back at the bar...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:37.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:42.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:49.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,...it was nothing compared to what I did at my bachelorette party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.17,0:16:52.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Talk about wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:07.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:41.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:45.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Just needed some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:48.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're making that thing for the general, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:51.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing Susie doesn't know anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, my lips are sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is, they would be if I had any.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, don't tell Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:05.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't tell Johnny what? - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you building that thing? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,If Sue finds out, you'll get an invisible kick in the nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, hey. We're keeping this quiet. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:20.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the wedding of the century. Reed Richards and Susan Storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Mr. Fantastic and the Invisible Woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,...will try again to tie the knot today in a ceremony in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:42.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look at these parasites. - I know, it's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:43.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have they no shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, listen! Listen, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:54.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is a very special day for my sister, probably the most important of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:58.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I just want to say to you guys, please respect our privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:00.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:03.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. We're auctioning off the exclusive wedding photos...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:08.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,...to the highest bidder, so go online and place your bids. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, are you planning...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:12.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what's it take to date the Human Torch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:17.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fireproof lingerie and a lot of aloe. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right? - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Invitation, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I should be on that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Name? - Stan Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice try, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:46.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, really. I'm Stan Lee. - Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't how I imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:55.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,It never is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:20:00.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Alicia, it just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:03.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sweetie...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:07.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,...I think even superheroes are allowed to have wedding-day jitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:12.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's more than that. Is my life always gonna be a circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:16.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do we really want to raise kids in all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:19.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Face it, we're not exactly normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:22.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben and I aren't normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:25.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,...but we don't let it get in the way of us being happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you love Reed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:32.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,More than I've ever loved anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:37.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:41.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:52.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, great. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:56.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got a zit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:21:00.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can't you put makeup on it? - No, no, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:02.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Crisis averted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:06.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now all I have to do is concentrate on the area for the next eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:13.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, come on. You're gonna miss your own wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:15.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:26.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,General, I'm putting the sensor online now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:36.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,There. If there's a surge in cosmic radiation anywhere, you'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:40.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's hope so. We've gotten reports of two more craters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:42.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here comes the bride
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Just linking it to my PDA.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:48.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Reed. - And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:51.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good, that's great. Now shave and put on your tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:53.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're getting married and you look like a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.11,0:21:56.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:59.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:03.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:13.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:18.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard of getting cold feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:25.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:27.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.11,0:22:32.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does that amaze anyone else? How did she know it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:36.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,To be honest, you kind of smell like ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:39.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're late. - Let's not make today about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:41.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Reed and Sue's big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:43.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's give them the attention for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:46.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:48.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, you're perfect. - You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:56.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll see you upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:04.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,So seems like you and Alicia are doing well. Annoyingly so, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.58,0:23:06.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm a lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.91,0:23:08.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:11.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Question for you, though:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.55,0:23:13.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:19.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- None of your business! - Okay, I'm just concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:23.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to find out she was killed in a rock slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a rock slide!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.05,0:23:47.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.30,0:23:59.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:02.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't tease him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.77,0:24:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:11.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I think it bothers you to see him really happy and in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.71,0:24:13.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.98,0:24:17.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think I'm jealous? Have you seen the women I've dated?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:19.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:25.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can only fool yourself but for so long, Torch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.96,0:24:30.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. It's the bride of stretchy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:33.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't start. - Don't listen to him. You look gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:34.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll see you out there, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.13,0:24:38.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on. We're on. - Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.11,0:24:44.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't look completely ridiculous in that dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.64,0:24:49.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that obnoxious-brother talk for "You look kind of nice"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:52.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:56.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.90,0:25:13.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.58,0:25:18.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.87,0:25:45.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, shut your cell phone off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:47.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, this is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.38,0:26:30.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dearly beloved, we are gathered here today to...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.98,0:26:36.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue and Reed, congratulations on your wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:40.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where was I? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:44.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dearly beloved, we are gathered here today to join this couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:47.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Reed Richards and Susan Storm, together...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:54.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,...in the bond of holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:26:58.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Matrimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.68,0:27:00.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you brought that to our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.11,0:27:03.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, but there's a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.25,0:27:05.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We have to do this quickly. - That's romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Should I continue? - Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.82,0:27:14.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There are many kinds of love. - Could you skip to the end, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:16.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Reed. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.00,0:27:27.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened? - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.29,0:27:43.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've lost power! We're going down! We're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.42,0:27:46.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.43,0:27:56.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Pull up! - I'm trying! I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.32,0:28:15.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:31.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Johnny. - This is Dolce.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.11,0:28:37.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flame on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.86,0:28:54.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, he's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:08.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.25,0:29:22.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, taxi! - Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:39.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Showoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:11.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.57,0:30:16.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.29,0:30:29.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.63,0:30:41.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flame on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.30,0:30:43.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flame on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.94,0:31:22.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your herald summons you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.84,0:31:25.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another world awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.51,0:31:28.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let it be done quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.69,0:31:38.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It looked like a man, but completely covered in silver, and it flew this, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:41.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,...surfboard-type thing. I know that sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.93,0:31:47.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you follow the shiny man to Lollipop Land or the Rainbow Junction?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.03,0:31:51.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I know what I saw. - Thank you. It's all right, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.77,0:31:56.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever this thing is, it has the ability to convert matter and energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.44,0:31:58.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,So it caused the anomalies?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.44,0:32:01.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems to radiate cosmic energy when it exerts itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.55,0:32:05.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,...randomly affecting matter. Evidently, this entity, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.49,0:32:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Silver Surfer...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.29,0:32:14.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,...didn't want to be detected. It destroyed the sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.23,0:32:17.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It knew it was being monitored? - And traced it back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.70,0:32:20.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with something highly resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.44,0:32:24.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.00,0:32:27.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I just... I gotta walk this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.24,0:32:34.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We must destroy it before it attacks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:37.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Richards, find me another way to track it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.52,0:32:46.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:49.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you, because I didn't want you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.96,0:32:52.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not mad you built the sensor. You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.67,0:32:59.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wasn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.87,0:33:04.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Sorry. Please continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.11,0:33:07.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,This proves what I've been saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.55,0:33:09.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could you drop the force field?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.55,0:33:11.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't even... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.25,0:33:14.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even our wedding turns into World War III.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.05,0:33:19.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. But once we are married, everything will be back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.32,0:33:23.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will never have normal lives as long as we do what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.39,0:33:26.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,How could we possibly raise a family like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.97,0:33:32.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go check on Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.72,0:33:47.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:56.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.30,0:33:59.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.73,0:34:03.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.50,0:34:06.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.84,0:34:11.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I've been feeling really strange since my run-in with surfer boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.51,0:34:14.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should get you checked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.55,0:34:17.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why did you do that? - I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.02,0:34:20.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop, drop and roll! Stop, drop and roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.35,0:34:24.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, Sue! Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.32,0:34:26.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just hang on! I'll get you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.96,0:34:29.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flame on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.86,0:34:32.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.83,0:34:38.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.37,0:34:40.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed! Reed!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.84,0:34:42.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Help! - Sue?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.71,0:34:44.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.41,0:34:47.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sue! What's going on? - I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.75,0:34:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're on fire! - You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.91,0:34:52.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hold on! - Pull me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.05,0:34:57.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the Human Torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.76,0:34:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:35:01.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm not Johnny! - Sue, how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.46,0:35:04.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I touched Johnny, and then this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.43,0:35:06.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where is Johnny? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.00,0:35:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.64,0:35:15.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Nice. - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.51,0:35:17.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.88,0:35:18.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue, your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.38,0:35:24.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why does this always happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:27.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of Sue's results are normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.19,0:35:28.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,But Johnny's...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.12,0:35:30.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny's are what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:36.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your encounter with the Surfer put your molecules in a constant state of flux.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.96,0:35:40.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.47,0:35:44.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,It caused you to temporarily switch powers with Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:47.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'd like to run more tests and... - Want a volunteer?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.21,0:35:48.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, no, hey! - No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.77,0:35:51.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, hey! This is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.64,0:35:53.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to give him a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.41,0:35:55.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't know the extent of his condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.78,0:35:57.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,It could be progressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.55,0:35:59.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It could be fun. - No, Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.68,0:36:01.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:05.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, it's me! I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.80,0:36:16.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.14,0:36:19.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! We just said this is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.84,0:36:21.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.74,0:36:25.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.25,0:36:30.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, not bad. - Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.08,0:36:33.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You better be able to fix this! - I'm right on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.35,0:36:37.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ben, stop it! - I see why you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.19,0:36:40.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.39,0:36:44.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.03,0:36:48.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not funny. What am I supposed to do in the meantime?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.37,0:36:51.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just try to keep your distance from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.67,0:36:57.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and me are gonna be spending a whole lot of time together, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:10.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,My inside sources tell me unlucky bride-to-be Sue Storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.69,0:37:13.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,...turned invisible and is staying that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.62,0:37:16.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,...after yesterday's embarrassing fiasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.59,0:37:20.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next, the Invisible Woman's greatest fashion blunders...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.53,0:37:24.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and an impromptu dance routine from former scientist Reed Richards.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.10,0:37:28.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep watching this? Just ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.24,0:37:32.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't ignore it, Reed. There's no getting away from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.51,0:37:34.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I believe there is. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.71,0:37:38.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? No answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.55,0:37:44.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:48.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if, after this crisis is over...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.16,0:37:52.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- ...we leave it all behind? - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.56,0:37:54.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,We move out of the Baxter Building.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.07,0:37:57.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take a teaching position somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.74,0:37:59.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back to my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.74,0:38:04.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The two of us will live our lives and raise a family, like normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:06.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You would do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.64,0:38:09.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing is more important to me than our future together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.42,0:38:13.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.49,0:38:21.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about Ben and Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.79,0:38:22.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.06,0:38:27.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, Johnny's always been more of a solo act.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:29.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's not mention it to them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.93,0:38:34.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny's got enough to worry about as it is, with his power problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.06,0:39:35.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've been busy, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.53,0:39:38.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your talents are impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.84,0:39:43.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.14,0:39:48.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Together, we could be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.91,0:39:53.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything would be ours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.38,0:39:56.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,All that you know is at an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:39:59.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.69,0:40:02.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! I said, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.22,0:40:30.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're breaking up the team. Reed and Sue, I overheard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.96,0:40:33.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,They want a nice, normal, boring-ass life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.89,0:40:35.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No more Fantastic Four. - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.13,0:40:38.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,...what do we do? Keep going, just the two of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.63,0:40:41.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,And call ourselves what? The Dynamic Duo?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.43,0:40:44.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,When were they gonna tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.47,0:40:46.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll tell you when they're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.00,0:40:48.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's their decision, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.01,0:40:52.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't be mad at them for doing what makes them happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.81,0:40:55.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.95,0:40:57.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.15,0:41:02.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I cross-referenced the Surfer's radiation through every astronomical database.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.72,0:41:06.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Altair 7, Rigel 3, Vega 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.32,0:41:09.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's been to all these planets? - And now they're lifeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.59,0:41:11.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barren. Some even shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.00,0:41:15.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everywhere the Surfer goes, eight days later, the planet dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.24,0:41:21.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.27,0:41:23.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't even know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.94,0:41:27.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about the craters?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.45,0:41:35.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,They appear in a numerical sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.62,0:41:38.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,The last crater was formed in Greenland...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.26,0:41:41.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,...so the next in the sequence should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.63,0:41:44.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,...latitude 51 degrees, 30 minutes north...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.70,0:41:50.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Iongitude zero degrees, seven minutes west.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.88,0:42:04.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,When he surfaces, move the fight away from the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.08,0:42:08.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's too fast to contain. When I see silver, I'm hitting him!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.32,0:42:11.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't do that. We stick to the plan and work as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.56,0:42:13.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're a team now? News to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:16.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about? - You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.33,0:42:17.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.80,0:42:21.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- When? When you moved our stuff out? - Johnny, this isn't a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.57,0:42:24.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kid's got a point, Reed. You should have told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:26.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's enough! We'll talk about this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.07,0:42:29.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.31,0:42:38.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a whirlpool!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.38,0:42:39.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.42,0:42:47.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.90,0:43:28.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.74,0:43:41.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Move! - Come on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.66,0:44:00.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.68,0:44:21.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.19,0:44:31.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben! Lift it higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.16,0:44:33.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.46,0:45:07.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.17,0:45:16.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay back, before you get somebody killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.11,0:45:21.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:42.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.93,0:45:46.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll make adjustments. Next time, we'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:49.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next time? There's no next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.07,0:45:53.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't handle this alone. I'm bringing in help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.61,0:45:57.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bringing in soldiers and weaponry will put innocent people in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.82,0:45:59.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,No more than you already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.12,0:46:06.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.02,0:46:10.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Afraid of ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.66,0:46:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look out! - Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.10,0:46:17.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Since you're a ghost, you won't mind if I break your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.84,0:46:19.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let him go. - You know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.90,0:46:22.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor von Doom. He's here under my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.35,0:46:30.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.15,0:46:35.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.19,0:46:39.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.29,0:46:43.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,No thanks to you four, that's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.66,0:46:47.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Von Doom's made contact with the alien. He's got valuable information.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.87,0:46:50.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Information that might just help save the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.34,0:46:53.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let's be clear about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.50,0:46:56.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,...shall we? I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.84,0:47:00.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.38,0:47:06.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,But the world's at stake and we need to work together to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.82,0:47:10.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,General, we know firsthand, you trust Victor and you're gonna regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:15.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,So far, the only one I've regretted trusting here is you, Richards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:18.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, don't agree to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.14,0:47:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see what he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.24,0:47:30.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I made a detailed recording of our little encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.01,0:47:34.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,All that you know is at an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.65,0:47:37.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.02,0:47:41.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like the part where he knocks you on your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.19,0:47:48.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at where the energy levels surge when he attacks me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.03,0:47:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,There? See what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:59.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,The energy was channeled through him, but it originated from his board.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.24,0:48:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we can separate him from the board, we can cut off his power completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.84,0:48:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's what we have to do. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.64,0:48:09.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I knew that, I wouldn't need you people, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.85,0:48:14.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You two should get started right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.29,0:48:22.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we have the opportunity to collaborate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.93,0:48:27.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll try to talk slowly so you can keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.87,0:48:37.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,How can we be working on the same side as Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.61,0:48:41.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got me. Things were simpler when I could just whale on the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.05,0:48:44.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's he doing? A fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.52,0:48:45.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.62,0:48:51.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.79,0:48:56.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, Ben, I'm starting to feel like a complete screw-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.63,0:48:59.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, you're not a complete screw-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.60,0:49:01.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.33,0:49:05.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, kid, it's out of our hands. It's up to the eggheads now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.77,0:49:10.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think Reed's right about the whole end-of-the-world thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.24,0:49:13.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's never been wrong about this kind of thing before.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.81,0:49:16.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm not exactly a deep kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.81,0:49:17.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.98,0:49:22.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,But if Reed's right, and this is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.92,0:49:28.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,...how do you want to spend your last few minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.99,0:49:31.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Part of me would like to go out fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:36.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,But the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.37,0:49:39.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,...I'd like to spend my last couple of minutes holding Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.17,0:49:44.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.44,0:49:47.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, not the "holding Alicia" thing. She's your girlfriend, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.11,0:49:51.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Want nothing to do with her. Not to say she's not attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.28,0:49:54.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's very attractive. She's so attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.89,0:49:59.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even with the... I can't think of a guy that wouldn't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.69,0:50:02.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.03,0:50:05.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,...was that it's nice to have somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.76,0:50:10.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you got me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.28,0:50:27.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.82,0:50:29.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't find a link.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.05,0:50:32.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It'll be all right. - No, it won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.52,0:50:36.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,The whole world's counting on me, and I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.39,0:50:38.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, you're gonna find the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.16,0:50:40.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You always do. - Thanks, Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.93,0:50:42.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You just need to relax. - Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.90,0:50:46.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You do. Reed, you need to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.40,0:50:49.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.24,0:50:52.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:54.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.31,0:50:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.45,0:51:04.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? I can already feel your pulse slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.89,0:51:08.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you remember that time... - A pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.26,0:51:12.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,A tachyon pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.60,0:51:15.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.93,0:51:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.39,0:51:40.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,So exactly how does this thing work?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.62,0:51:44.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we activate the field, it'll separate him from his board making him powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.89,0:51:46.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like a fish in a net.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.56,0:51:49.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.43,0:51:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- In theory, anyway. - How long until it's operational?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.80,0:51:55.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Three hours. - Three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.37,0:51:58.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can only go so fast, since I'm working by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.41,0:52:02.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do you need to make this happen? - There are a couple of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.28,0:52:05.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do your field engineers have a beryllium casing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.83,0:52:17.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.76,0:52:21.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't you knock? - You're supposed to be helping Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.83,0:52:23.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell him not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.20,0:52:26.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be there to hold his hand and finish his little project for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.41,0:52:34.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Anything else? - How'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.81,0:52:38.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.99,0:52:43.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It scares you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.66,0:52:48.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,The things I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.13,0:52:51.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you know I could create a force field inside someone's body...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.96,0:52:53.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and expand it until they explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.67,0:52:56.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.07,0:53:03.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just get back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.71,0:53:12.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.52,0:53:16.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're heading to intercept the Surfer in 10 minutes, with or without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.22,0:53:21.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Were you waiting outside the bathroom to try and catch me in a towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.00,0:53:30.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was a joke. I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.87,0:53:33.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you so down on me? You don't even know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.20,0:53:37.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you very well. I read your personality profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.04,0:53:40.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Confident. Reckless. Irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:42.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Self-obsessed, bordering on narcissism.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.58,0:53:45.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you do know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.12,0:53:49.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,All I've seen is a guy that almost got his team killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.42,0:53:52.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.59,0:53:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been a little off my game lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.76,0:53:57.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is not a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.74,0:54:14.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sir, he's in position north of here. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.28,0:54:17.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- General, give us a one-mile perimeter. - Forget it, Richards.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.38,0:54:20.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You had your shot and you blew it. This is a military operation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.82,0:54:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jam the signal, get out of the way, and let us do our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.25,0:54:27.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You don't understand. - No, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.59,0:54:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,So let me make it clear for you and your pack of freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.59,0:54:33.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the quarterback. You're on my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.10,0:54:35.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.30,0:54:41.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I guess you never played football in high school, did you, Richards?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.91,0:54:43.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you're right, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.27,0:54:47.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I stayed in and studied, like a good little nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.15,0:54:51.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,And fifteen years later...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.45,0:54:54.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,...I'm one of the greatest minds of the 21 st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.55,0:54:56.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm engaged to the hottest girl on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.55,0:55:00.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the jock who played quarterback in high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.66,0:55:03.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,...is right in front of me, asking me for my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.29,0:55:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I say he's not gonna get a damn thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.66,0:55:10.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,...unless he does exactly what I tell him to...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.50,0:55:14.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and starts treating my friends and me with some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.35,0:55:25.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give him what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.48,0:55:29.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am so hot for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.65,0:55:32.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.37,0:55:46.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.24,0:55:51.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have your coordinates. Set up your posts and rendezvous back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.92,0:56:05.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,First squad, move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.59,0:56:42.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. You scared me there, Smokey. Look at you. You're cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.90,0:56:52.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right. Keep running, Boo Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.24,0:56:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Overgrown furball.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.57,0:57:00.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's our status? - Yeah. I'm good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.31,0:57:02.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Same here. - Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.06,0:57:15.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:18.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We have a problem. - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.46,0:57:19.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.40,0:57:23.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.96,0:57:47.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you destroying our planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.73,0:57:51.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.96,0:57:53.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sue! - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.03,0:57:59.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, you don't have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.47,0:58:01.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's always a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.84,0:58:04.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.14,0:58:08.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to destroy us?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.95,0:58:11.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am not the Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.65,0:58:15.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Richards. Jam the damn signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.52,0:58:18.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe he needs a little persuasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.52,0:58:21.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fire one over the top. - Roger, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.47,0:58:37.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Open fire. - Open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.81,0:58:39.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Open fire! Repeat, open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.55,0:58:50.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fall back! Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.52,0:58:55.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let me just... - No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.19,0:58:58.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.66,0:59:00.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.43,0:59:04.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, it's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.43,0:59:06.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.67,0:59:07.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.13,0:59:36.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not so tough now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.08,0:59:47.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.98,0:59:49.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the quarterback.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.43,1:00:09.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eyes on! Keep your weapons trained!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.47,1:00:12.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Perimeter secure! - Move him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.98,1:00:21.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Open the gate! - Get him to the debriefing room.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.82,1:00:36.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We had an agreement. - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.63,1:00:38.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,The enemy has been captured.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.50,1:00:40.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where is he? - Contained.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.13,1:00:42.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,General?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:45.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sherman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.04,1:00:50.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse us, we have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.54,1:00:53.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I want to be there for the questioning. - Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.98,1:00:57.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make sure our guests remain here, comfortably.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.71,1:00:58.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.32,1:01:03.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,General, what about the board?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.42,1:01:07.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's in a chamber which continuously scrambles the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.74,1:01:27.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are certain things I'm not permitted to do...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.44,1:01:30.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,...because they're considered human-rights violations.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.25,1:01:33.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, you're not human.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.82,1:01:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are we prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.69,1:01:44.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.19,1:01:47.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they don't want us interfering with their methods.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.40,1:01:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what they're doing to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:52.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I say he gets what he deserves. - How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.10,1:01:55.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying maybe the general's right about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.07,1:01:59.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guy was about to destroy the planet. He said so himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.34,1:02:04.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense. He protected me from the missile. Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.21,1:02:06.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe he thinks you're cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.18,1:02:09.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's more going on. He said he wasn't the Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.29,1:02:10.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe he lied?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.79,1:02:17.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to get inside there and talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.53,1:02:20.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,But under the radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.57,1:02:27.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there any way we could get some DVDs...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.00,1:02:29.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,...or popcorn or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.07,1:02:31.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll call it in. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.87,1:02:33.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Semper fi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.94,1:02:36.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the Marine Corps. We're the Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.81,1:02:39.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, I know it's the Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.02,1:02:48.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain Raye. Access granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.94,1:03:05.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.61,1:03:08.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Von Doom wants to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.58,1:03:11.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should really be a little more cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.15,1:03:14.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sherman, let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.87,1:03:34.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you are there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.12,1:03:48.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.89,1:03:52.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, you must have a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.72,1:03:55.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Susan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:05.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,You said you weren't the one trying to destroy our world. Then who is?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.20,1:04:07.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The one I serve. - Who do you serve?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.84,1:04:15.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you, but to do that, you have to tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.85,1:04:17.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.56,1:04:32.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is known by many names. My people called it...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.06,1:04:35.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Galactus...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.23,1:04:36.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,...the Devourer of Worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.70,1:04:44.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It must feed on energy to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.57,1:04:45.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Both thermal...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.71,1:04:47.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and organic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.01,1:04:49.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,How can you serve this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.71,1:04:51.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I must.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.38,1:04:55.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it bother you, all the worlds and innocent people you've helped destroy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.25,1:05:00.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,My service spares my world...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.69,1:05:02.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and the one I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.29,1:05:07.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why did you try to protect me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.03,1:05:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.53,1:05:15.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,...you remind me of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.19,1:05:31.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could you stop the Destroyer if you wanted to?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.59,1:05:35.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is not I who draws the Destroyer here. It is the beacon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.76,1:05:37.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the beacon?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.49,1:05:39.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,The source of my power.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.80,1:05:40.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your board?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:49.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take joy in the last few hours you have left...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.34,1:05:51.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,...for he is nearly here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.52,1:06:12.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well? I helped deliver the alien to you, as promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.43,1:06:15.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to keep your end of the bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.27,1:06:18.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can do your tests on the board...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.84,1:06:23.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,...but under armed guard and in my presence only.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.84,1:06:26.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.85,1:06:35.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,General Hager. Access granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.08,1:07:00.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,The board draws it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.58,1:07:02.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you fight something that eats planets?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.71,1:07:05.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to get to the board and lead it away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:08.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, do you think the general will go for that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.85,1:07:10.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.66,1:07:15.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, general.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.89,1:07:17.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.19,1:07:19.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,...the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.20,1:07:22.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,...sometimes Reed is right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.34,1:07:27.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.35,1:07:42.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.89,1:07:44.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.02,1:08:48.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.82,1:08:54.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.43,1:09:02.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.97,1:09:08.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, that one hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:12.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Reed? - Back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.32,1:09:24.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.86,1:09:34.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.53,1:09:41.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor. We've gotta get it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.67,1:09:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to get the Surfer. He understands its power.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.54,1:09:48.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even if we break him out of this place, how are we gonna catch up to Victor?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.95,1:09:51.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.11,1:10:23.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Halt! - Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.85,1:10:30.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pal, this is the luckiest day of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.29,1:10:36.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on? Where is General Hager?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.76,1:10:37.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.19,1:10:40.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if we don't get him out of here, we'll all be.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.03,1:10:42.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frankie...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.70,1:10:48.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,...the world is literally at stake here. You have to trust us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.74,1:10:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.21,1:10:57.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to get to the roof. It should be here by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.15,1:11:00.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,What should be here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.46,1:11:11.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.63,1:11:13.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.40,1:11:16.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is by far the coolest thing you have ever done.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.94,1:11:27.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hemi? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.98,1:11:31.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ben, you get inside. Johnny, you fly behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.85,1:11:35.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You gotta let me fly this. - I'm the best pilot. I should drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.42,1:11:37.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Guys. - You're lucky if it can carry you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.65,1:11:39.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can fly circles around you. - Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.09,1:11:43.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Reed. - Shut up! And move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.36,1:11:45.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.06,1:11:49.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flame on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.31,1:12:00.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. We're now officially enemies of the United States of America.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.08,1:12:03.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor is out there somewhere with unlimited power.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.98,1:12:06.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we've got a giant intergalactic force...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.78,1:12:11.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,...that's about to destroy our planet in less than 24 hours. Did I miss anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.39,1:12:15.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've locked on Victor's energy trail. He's headed over Southeast China.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.13,1:12:17.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.80,1:12:23.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Norrin Radd.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.13,1:12:29.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - I was once called Norrin Radd.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.37,1:12:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Norrin, we'll need your help to save our world.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.51,1:12:35.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.75,1:12:42.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.19,1:12:48.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, the board is drawing the Destroyer here. You have to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.82,1:12:51.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I've never been the giving type, Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.56,1:12:53.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.44,1:13:08.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're sitting ducks!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.91,1:13:10.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to split up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.68,1:13:12.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - This ought to be fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.61,1:13:43.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's really pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.39,1:13:52.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surf's up, metalhead!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.29,1:13:59.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, only the Surfer can stop the Destroyer. But he needs his board.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.43,1:14:02.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come and get it, Richards. - Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.64,1:14:10.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's all go for a spin!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.55,1:14:51.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Norrin!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.25,1:14:54.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.86,1:15:10.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.40,1:15:16.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.07,1:15:18.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue. Sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.87,1:15:21.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, God. - Johnny, don't touch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.01,1:15:26.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.48,1:15:28.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You need to find a way to get the board.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.72,1:15:31.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sue, I... - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.53,1:15:40.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,He is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.04,1:15:50.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.54,1:15:52.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.41,1:15:58.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor's gotta have a pulse emitter linking him to his board.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.21,1:16:01.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We take it out, we can separate him from his board.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.88,1:16:03.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's too strong for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.32,1:16:05.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could whale on him if I get close...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.45,1:16:08.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,...but he could see me coming from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.63,1:16:11.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,It would take all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.13,1:16:14.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or maybe just one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.37,1:16:21.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't know what it could do to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.64,1:16:24.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's not make this about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.76,1:16:48.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,To quote a friend of mine...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.06,1:16:50.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,...it's clobbering time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.36,1:17:49.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You ain't going down fighting, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.16,1:17:52.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.33,1:19:32.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.59,1:20:05.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Treasure each moment with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.56,1:20:07.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,And tell her she was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.36,1:20:11.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We do have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.99,1:20:39.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thought you could use a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.33,1:20:45.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.66,1:21:17.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it working?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.73,1:21:20.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.14,1:21:31.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will no longer serve.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.38,1:21:38.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the end for us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.80,1:23:01.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.87,1:23:05.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.48,1:23:11.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.19,1:23:21.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.12,1:23:25.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He did it. - Great job, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.66,1:23:29.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait. I'm not changing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.63,1:23:32.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.20,1:23:34.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.64,1:23:38.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you're making me uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.39,1:23:59.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.20,1:24:02.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,We all go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.06,1:24:04.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.33,1:24:06.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.17,1:24:08.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No? - Lf not for the team...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.80,1:24:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,...the whole world would be gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.57,1:24:14.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't run away from our responsibilities. This is who we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.11,1:24:18.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's what I've been saying. - What about having a normal life?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.38,1:24:20.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A family? - Who says you have to be normal...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.75,1:24:22.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,...to have a family?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.72,1:24:28.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,So are you up for another media-circus wedding? Fifth time's a charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.72,1:24:30.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.59,1:24:34.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.74,1:24:50.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dearly beloved, we are gathered here today to join Reed Richards...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.88,1:24:54.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and Sue Storm together in holy...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.25,1:24:56.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,...matrimony.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.99,1:24:59.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is it? - Venice is sinking into the Adriatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.12,1:25:01.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. That's a biggie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.12,1:25:04.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could we just skip to the end?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.79,1:25:08.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. The love these two share... - No, the very end.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.56,1:25:11.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, great. You have the rings?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.87,1:25:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.08,1:25:24.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I now pronounce you man and wife, and you may kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.39,1:25:33.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay. We should get out of here. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.16,1:25:36.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Gotta go, hon. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.76,1:25:42.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to throw the bouquet.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.13,1:25:44.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.71,1:25:55.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heads up, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.29,1:26:08.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.22,1:26:10.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,《神奇四侠2：银影侠现身》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:29.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,(日本 骏河湾)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿俊,你每天都鱼腥味好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:35.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 啊?你不也是么? - 这才叫做男子汉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:43.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 阿俊 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:48.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:49.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,快上船
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:53.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,这究竟是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:02:59.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,(埃及 吉萨金字塔)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:21.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,(加利福尼亚 洛杉矶)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:33.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,昨晚,神秘的大面积停电席卷美国西部
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:36.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,联邦航空局被迫暂停所有航班 致使成千上万的旅客滞留
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:40.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是今天最大的新闻是倍受瞩目的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,神奇情侣里德·理查斯和苏·史东的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:48.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,将在本周六举行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:53.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,难以置信,全球各地持续发生异常的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:57.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,违背破物理定律的古怪现象
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:01.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,而所有的媒体却只关心 我们会选哪种样式的瓷器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:06.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你选了哪一种?蓝底碎花的? 我真的很喜欢那个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:07.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,请原谅,你介不介意跟我合张影?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:11.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 又来了,是不是? - 好的,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:14.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我们什么都不会推迟 这次绝不推迟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:19.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,这将会是你梦想中的婚礼 我不会让任何事情破坏它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:24.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算是那些神秘的 亚原子连锁转化也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:28.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你对我说过的最浪漫的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,仔细想想,却又觉得有些悲凉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:35.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,理查斯博士,非常抱歉 但机位已经订光了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:39.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不过还有一些经济舱的座位 - 照了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:40.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 笑一笑 - 太棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:45.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好极了,我们再来一张 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃,那是我的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:53.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:08.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,劳驾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:23.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们觉得我们帮航空公司代言如何? 说不定可以给我们一台私人飞机喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:26.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们已经代言够多的东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:32.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好笑,说真的,里德,这些资金 对你发明的那些小东西有帮助呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:35.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,谢谢了 - 劳驾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:38.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 考虑一下吧,回头再谈 - 强尼,你要去哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不坐经济舱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,真希望老天下场雨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:02.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,大雪突降,没有预兆 气温也没有变化
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,金字塔被两英尺厚的大雪覆盖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:08.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,而在日本,有人认为海湾被冰冻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:11.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,是由于海底火山活动引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是从未有报道说在 该地区有这类地质活动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,科学家们已经排除了全球气候变暖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:20.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,是全球各地产生极端气候现象的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:23.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,科学家们无法解释这些奇异的现象
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:27.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人开始怀疑是否是上帝旨意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:30.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在播送其它新闻 里德·理查斯和苏珊·史东的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:32.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,轰动了曼哈顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:36.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,宾客名单中包括了诸多 纽约政商界的精英
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:39.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:43.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,市政府责令我们赔偿3辆警察巡逻车 他们说是我们破坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:47.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是在那次的抢劫运钞车事件 但我记得只掀翻了两辆警车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:56.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,好的,好的 我放到一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚刚说什么来着?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我半个小时后要去试婚纱 然后选乐师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:06.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还没选好场景布置还有鲜花 需要做的事情太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:10.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,不要担心,我肯定 我们两会一起把一切搞定的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么我进来的时候你在干什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:15.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我正在输入我的任务清单 - 真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:18.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 以童子军的荣誉担保 - 嘿,伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,新制服出炉了,你们觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:26.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们决不会穿的,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:29.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你对资本主义有看法啊?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只是我个人爱好 - 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:39.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,究竟是个玩具啊 还是搞科学研究用的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,都有点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:48.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道,我对你这种 操作方式深恶痛绝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:50.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,苏说我对这个上瘾了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白她为什么会那样说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:08:01.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,小声点,但是我交叉分析了 全球紊乱现象
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:05.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们是由宇宙辐射引起的 但又不像是给我们提供能量的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:08.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇,那可真够无聊的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:13.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,我有件非常重要的 婚礼事宜要和你商量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:17.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的告别单身派对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要,说真的,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:24.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼,民意测验表明强尼 心理年龄比其外表年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:29.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,说真的,强尼,不要办告别单身派对 那不是我的行事风格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:35.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就为了本,这对那个大家伙很重要 不然会伤透他的心的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:37.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的心可是石头做的,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚礼前我有很多事情要做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:42.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想苏也会有意见的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:45.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我觉得苏会对什么有意见吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果有人告诉她 你实际上正在调查…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:50.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,全球紊乱现象和宇宙辐射…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,而不是像你保证的那样,专注于婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 告别单身派对应该很有趣 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,但不要脱衣舞娘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,(拉脱维亚 哈森斯丹特)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:10:00.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就是这儿了? - 这里没一个我认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,我本来应该邀请一些你的朋友的 但是你没有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:05.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼,我们说好了的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:11.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,她们不是脱衣舞娘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,她们只是辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:21.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是神奇先生,对吧?你太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:26.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇,你真的很帅呦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:29.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,来杯喝的,用你们这里最大的杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:31.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚上好,欢迎来到巴克斯特大厦…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:55.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么能为你们效劳的 你们不能乘那电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,史东女士马上就到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:08.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们好?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,罗贝塔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,有何贵干?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:18.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们要见理查斯博士 - 很抱歉,他现在不在,我能帮忙吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,你可以带我们去见理查斯博士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.31,0:11:24.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:34.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:40.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,当整个宇宙起源的时候 还没一块小石子大,然后"碰"的一声
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,它爆炸了,在万亿分之一秒的时间内…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:47.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,它就扩张成了我们所知道的 宇宙现在的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇,你真的好聪明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:53.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,坎蒂,你这么说我很感动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:56.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱死这首歌了,你想跳舞吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:58.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,我不想 - 不,你想跳的,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,说真的 - 来吧,你一定跳的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:02.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不想让你们难堪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,放松点,开心些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:18.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样,对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:24.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:36.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这家伙可真会放松 - 真不是开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在那儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:13.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,对他来说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想舞厅差不多可以打烊了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:29.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,你来...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:34.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈格将军
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:36.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们找个没人的地方谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:40.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非你想在谁的肚皮上玩鸡尾酒果冻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是向女孩们解释 宇宙大爆炸,就这些…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:49.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这都是强尼的主意,我只是跟着来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:53.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德怎么会认识将军
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:57.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,几年前,五角大楼想建造新的 导弹防御体系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德证实了那技术不可行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这里的唯一原因是 我收到参谋长联席会议的直接命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:07.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,个人来说,我不喜欢和 平民科学家分享敏感信息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:11.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,其是那些非常喜欢抛头露脸的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.61,0:14:14.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,见到你总是很荣幸,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能为你做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:20.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该知道了 最近全球发生了一些不寻常的现象
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:24.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,官方已经尽量在公众中保持低调 但我们担心…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:29.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些不正常现象 可能会对国家安全产生重大威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:33.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些是我们一颗卫星三天前拍摄到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:39.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么? - 我们希望理查斯博士可以告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:43.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我恐怕从未看到过类似的东西,本?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:49.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本会以为那是颗陨石 但运行轨迹又完全不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:51.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个东西本身具有动力源
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,再看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:57.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些是奇异事件开始后 地球一些偏远地区的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:01.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,地质勘探到这个洞直径大概有200米
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:06.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了搞清楚这到底是怎么一回事 我们需要想办法定位并阻拦那个物体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:10.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也许能建造一个感应器 和巴克斯特大楼的卫星网络连接
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:13.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以精确定位那个物体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:18.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很好,你为我们制造感应器并连接到… - 恐怕不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:26.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看,我这周六就要结婚了,没有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:32.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,理查斯,你的国家需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:35.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么不给杰夫·瓦格纳教授打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是布朗大学物理系的主任 我肯定他能帮助你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:40.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来抱着更高的期望的,理查斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:43.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算是从你这种人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼·史东,神奇四侠公司的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:03.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你有做过职业模特吗? - 不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:06.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 因为你有非常好的条件 - 不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:13.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇,你就那么走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:15.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还没说完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:19.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信你拒绝了一项科研计划
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:23.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,没我他们也能造出一个感应器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:26.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,目前最重要的事情就是我们的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:28.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能延期,不能被打扰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:33.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧,我希望你刚才在酒吧的看到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:37.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,我知道你的为人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你玩得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:42.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:49.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,比起我在告别单身派对上做的事 你的那些根本不值一提
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.17,0:16:52.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以说是狂野
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,狂野?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:07.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:41.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,你在上边干吗呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:45.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么,就是透透气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:48.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在给将军造那个机器,是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:51.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜苏西还被蒙在鼓里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,我的嘴唇缝上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我根本没有嘴唇…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,别告诉强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:05.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别告诉强尼什么? - 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在造那个东西吗? - 不,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果苏发现了 她肯定会隐身踢爆你老二的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿,小声点别说出去 - 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:20.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们把这个称作"世纪婚礼" 里德·理查斯和苏珊·史东
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,也被称为神奇先生和隐身女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,将在今天在纽约举行庆典 正式结成连理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:42.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看看那些寄生虫 - 我明白,令人难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,听着,所有人听着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:54.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天是我姐姐大喜的日子 是她一生中最重要的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:58.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就想和大家说 请你们尊重我们的隐私
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:00.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,笑一个,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:03.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈哈,开玩笑啦 我们将会把独家婚礼照片拍卖给出价最高的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:08.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,卖给出价最高的人,所以上网出价竞拍吧 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼,你们计划…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:12.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,和霹雳火约会的需要些什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:17.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 防火性感内衣,还有很多芦荟 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 最近好吗? - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,邀请函,先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该在那个名单上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 名字 - 史坦·李 (神奇四侠原作者)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,真会编,老兄,真会编
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:46.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,不,不,真的,我是史坦·李 - 真会编
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是我想像中的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:55.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,从来就和想像不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:20:00.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,艾莉莎,就是感觉很不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:03.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:07.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想就算是超级英雄 也会在结婚日胡思乱想的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:12.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不止是那样 难道我的生活将永远像个马戏团吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:16.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们真的想在这样环境下生儿育女吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:19.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,面对现实吧,我们不是普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,本和我也不是普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:25.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们不会让这 成为我们追求幸福的障碍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你爱里德吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:32.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,胜过爱其他任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:37.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你就什么都不要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:41.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:52.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦,糟糕 - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:56.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我长了个暗疮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:21:00.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 需要用妆补一补吗? - 不,不用,我能处理
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:02.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,危机解除
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:06.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在要做的就是 全神贯注那个部位,坚持8个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:13.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德,快点,你快赶不及你的婚礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:15.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就完工
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:26.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军,我现在就把感应器连接到网络\N系统在线
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:36.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果地球上任何地方发生宇宙辐射 你就会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:40.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望如此,理查斯 我们已经收到报告,又多了两个圆洞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:42.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,新娘要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,好的,我把这个 和我的PDA连在一起就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:48.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 里德 - 还有…成了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:51.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,太好了! 现在你该刮胡子,穿礼服了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:53.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你快结婚了,却搞的象个叫花子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.11,0:21:56.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:03.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:13.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:18.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说过新娘落跑…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:25.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:27.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.11,0:22:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,太令人吃惊了,她怎么会知道是我的? 我又没说话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:36.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,说实话,你闻上去有股烟灰的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:39.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哈哈哈,你晚了 - 今天我可不是主角
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:41.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天是里德和苏的大日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:43.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该转一转注意力了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:46.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,别那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:48.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你看上去完美极了 - 你也很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:56.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,待会楼上见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:04.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,看上去你和艾莉莎相处的很好 真是让人忌妒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.58,0:23:06.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,我很幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.91,0:23:08.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.55,0:23:13.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个是如何…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:19.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这不关你的事 - 好的,我是关心你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:23.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想你早上醒来,发现她被落石砸死
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要让你看看什么才是落石
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.05,0:23:47.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你究竟是什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.30,0:23:59.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不应该总那么戏弄他
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.77,0:24:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:11.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道,我觉得你看到他沉浸在 爱的幸福之中,困扰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.71,0:24:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得你是嫉妒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.98,0:24:17.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得我是嫉妒? 你看到我约会的女人了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:19.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:25.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只是在自欺欺人,霹雳火
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.96,0:24:30.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,橡皮人的新娘来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:33.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别说了 - 别听他的,你看上去光彩照人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:34.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去外面等你,小甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.13,0:24:38.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 来吧,我们上 - 好的,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.11,0:24:44.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道,你穿婚纱看上去并不那么可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.64,0:24:49.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的烦人弟弟是在说 "你看上去挺漂亮"的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:52.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看上去漂亮极了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:56.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.90,0:25:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸会为你骄傲的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.58,0:25:18.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.87,0:25:45.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德,把手机关了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:47.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.38,0:26:30.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友们 我们今天聚集于此是要…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.98,0:26:36.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,里德,祝贺你们终成眷属
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:40.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,说到哪儿了?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:44.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友们,我们今天聚集于此 来参加这对情侣
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:47.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德·理查斯先生和苏·史东女士一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:54.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,缔结…神圣的…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.23,0:26:56.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,(警报!宇宙辐射)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:26:58.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚姻…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.68,0:27:00.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 你把这东西带到我们婚礼上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.11,0:27:03.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,但事出有因
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.25,0:27:05.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们必须尽快结束 - 那可真够浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我可以继续吗 - 是的,请继续
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.82,0:27:14.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 世上有很多种爱 - 能直接说结尾吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 里德 - 怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.00,0:27:27.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了? - 这是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.29,0:27:43.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们失去动力 我们要坠毁了,我们要坠毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.42,0:27:46.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.43,0:27:56.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拉升啊,拉升啊 - 我在努力,我在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.32,0:28:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,本
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:31.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 强尼 - 这衣服可是杜嘉班纳的（著名服装品牌）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.11,0:28:37.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,点火
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.86,0:28:54.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计,他真快
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:08.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.25,0:29:22.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿,出租车 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:39.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,游戏结束
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:11.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,是时候结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.57,0:30:16.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能谈一谈吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.29,0:30:29.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.63,0:30:41.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,点火!快点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.30,0:30:43.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,点火
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.94,0:31:22.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的主人召唤你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.84,0:31:25.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,另一个世界还在等着你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.51,0:31:28.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,让它尽快结束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.69,0:31:38.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,他看上去像人类,但是全身被银装 而且用来飞的道具就象…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:41.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,象冲浪板一样的东西 我知道听上去很疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,一点也不
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.93,0:31:47.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你跟着闪光人飞到了"糖果大地" 去了"彩虹尽头"喽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.03,0:31:51.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我知道我看到了什么 - 谢谢,没关系,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.77,0:31:56.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论这东西的到底是什么 它都有将物质和能量转换的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.44,0:31:58.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以是它引起了奇怪现象
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.44,0:32:01.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,看上去好像他发力时会发出宇宙辐射
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.55,0:32:05.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,并随机影响物质 很显然,这个实体…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.49,0:32:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个银色冲浪手
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.29,0:32:14.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不想被探测到,所以摧毁了感应器
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.23,0:32:17.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他知道被监测到了 - 而且追踪到了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.70,0:32:20.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们对付的东西有高度智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.44,0:32:24.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.00,0:32:27.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,我去走走就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.24,0:32:34.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,在它再次攻击前,我们必须摧毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:37.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,理查斯,用别的办法找到它
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.52,0:32:46.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,真的太抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:49.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没告诉你的原因是不想让你担心
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.96,0:32:52.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是生气你制造了感应器 这没错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.67,0:32:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.87,0:33:04.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,对不起,请继续
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.11,0:33:07.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧,这证明了我一直在说的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.55,0:33:09.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能去掉这个能量场吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.55,0:33:11.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能连…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.25,0:33:14.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能连婚礼搞成了第三次世界大战
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.05,0:33:19.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,但是一旦我们结婚了 所有的事情都会趋于正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.32,0:33:23.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我们继续从事这项事业 我们永远都不能过正常的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.39,0:33:26.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么可能这样组成一个家庭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.97,0:33:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去看看强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.72,0:33:47.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:56.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.30,0:33:59.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,你还好吧老弟?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.73,0:34:03.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.50,0:34:06.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.84,0:34:11.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道,和冲浪手接触后感觉很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.51,0:34:14.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该给你检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.55,0:34:17.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么做 - 我什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.02,0:34:20.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动,快倒地翻滚 别动,快倒地翻滚
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.35,0:34:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,天啊,苏,快…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.32,0:34:26.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住,我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.96,0:34:29.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,点火
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.86,0:34:32.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,看着点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.83,0:34:38.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.37,0:34:40.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德,里德
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.84,0:34:42.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 救命啊 - 苏?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.71,0:34:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.41,0:34:47.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 苏,出什么事了? - 我着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.75,0:34:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你着火了 - 你觉得呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.91,0:34:52.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 坚持住 - 拉我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.05,0:34:57.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,是霹雳火
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.76,0:34:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:35:01.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不是强尼 - 苏,怎么会这样?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.46,0:35:04.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我摸了下强尼就变成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.43,0:35:06.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 强尼在哪 - 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.00,0:35:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,再碰一次
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.64,0:35:15.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.51,0:35:17.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.88,0:35:18.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,你的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.38,0:35:24.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么这种事总发生在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:27.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏的所有结果都正常
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.19,0:35:28.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过强尼的…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.12,0:35:30.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼的怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:36.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和冲浪手的接触导致了你的分子结构 不稳定,持续波动中
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.96,0:35:40.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,那很糟糕吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.47,0:35:44.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,那让你暂时和苏交换了能力
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要多做点测试就更理想了 - 需要志愿者吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.21,0:35:48.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不不不不,嘿 - 不要,不要,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.77,0:35:51.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不要,嗨,这是很严肃的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.64,0:35:53.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想抱抱他
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.41,0:35:55.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还不知道他状况到了什么地步
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.78,0:35:57.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能恶化,也可能好转
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.55,0:35:59.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可能会很好玩 - 不要啊,本
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.68,0:36:01.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,本
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:05.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,嘿,是我,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.80,0:36:16.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.14,0:36:19.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,我们刚说过这是很严肃的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.84,0:36:21.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,是的,严肃的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.74,0:36:25.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,你一定是耍我玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.25,0:36:30.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿,不错啊 - 难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.08,0:36:33.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 里德,你最好把这搞定 - 我会马上动手的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.35,0:36:37.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 本,别这样 - 我开始明白你为什么喜欢那样了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.19,0:36:40.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,别,别,别,别
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.39,0:36:44.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,真垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.03,0:36:48.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,那一点都不好玩 现在我该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.37,0:36:51.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽量和我们保持距离
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.67,0:36:57.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们将会一起相处很长一段时间的,老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:10.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的内部线人透露 不幸的准新娘的苏·史东
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.69,0:37:13.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,在昨天让人难堪的事件中隐身后
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.62,0:37:16.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,持续人间蒸发中
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.59,0:37:20.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来播放激动人心的 隐形女出糗时尚秀
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.53,0:37:24.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,以及前任科学家里德·理查斯 表演的即兴舞蹈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.10,0:37:28.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么老是要看这些,别理他们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.24,0:37:32.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没法不看,里德 根本无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.51,0:37:34.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我相信会有办法的 - 怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.71,0:37:38.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.55,0:37:44.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,有的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:48.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,假如,这次危机结束后…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.16,0:37:52.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们把所有的都抛开 - 你想说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.56,0:37:54.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们搬出巴克斯特大厦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.07,0:37:57.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去从教
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.74,0:37:59.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是做回我的研究工作
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.74,0:38:04.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们两个会有自己的生活 组成家庭,就象普通人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:06.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你愿意那么做吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.64,0:38:09.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说我们的未来才是最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.42,0:38:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.49,0:38:21.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,那本和强尼怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.79,0:38:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会理解的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.06,0:38:27.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且,强尼更喜欢单打独斗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:29.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们先别和他们说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.93,0:38:34.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,强尼最近对于他能力的问题 已经够操心的了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.50,0:38:40.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,(格棱兰岛 罗素冰河)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.06,0:39:35.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最近很忙啊,我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.53,0:39:38.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的才华让人印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.84,0:39:43.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能听懂我说的话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.14,0:39:48.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在一起,将无人能敌
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.91,0:39:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,为所欲为
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.38,0:39:56.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你所认知的都将被终结
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:39:59.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.69,0:40:02.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我说了,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.22,0:40:30.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们要解散队伍 里德和苏,我刚偷听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.96,0:40:33.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想过美好普通无聊之极的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.89,0:40:35.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 神奇四侠将不复存在了 - 那…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.13,0:40:38.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么办 就剩我们两个干下去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.63,0:40:41.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们管自己叫什么,爆破双人组?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.43,0:40:44.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们要什么时候才告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.47,0:40:46.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们准备好了就会告诉你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.00,0:40:48.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是他们的决定 不是你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.01,0:40:52.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不能因为他们 追求自己的幸福而生气
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.81,0:40:55.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.95,0:40:57.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们有大麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.15,0:41:02.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在每个天文数据库里面 对冲浪手辐射进行了比较
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.72,0:41:06.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,牵牛星7号,参宿七3号,织女星6号
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.32,0:41:09.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他去过所有的那些星球? - 现在那里已经毫无生命迹象了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.59,0:41:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,荒芜,有些甚至破碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.00,0:41:15.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,冲浪手去过的地方 八天后,所到星球就死亡了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.24,0:41:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎样才能阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.27,0:41:23.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们甚至不知道他在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.94,0:41:27.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些坑洞呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.45,0:41:35.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们的出现是有规律可循的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.62,0:41:38.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近的一个坑洞在格陵兰岛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.26,0:41:41.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么下个坑洞应该在…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.63,0:41:44.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,北纬51度30分
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.70,0:41:50.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,西经0度7分
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.88,0:42:04.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,当冲浪手出现时 我们要远离人群才开战
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.08,0:42:08.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,他太快了,根本控制不住 我一看到他,就立刻展开攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.32,0:42:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能那么做 要按照计划,集体行动
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.56,0:42:13.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在是个团队啊 对我来说真是新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:16.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么? - 你知道我在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.33,0:42:17.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会告诉你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.80,0:42:21.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么时候?你搬出巴克斯特大厦的时候? - 强尼,现在不是吵架的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.57,0:42:24.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这孩子说的有道理,里德 你们该告诉我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:26.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,好吧,说够了吧 我们以后再谈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.07,0:42:29.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们到底他妈的出什么问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.31,0:42:38.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,是旋涡
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.38,0:42:39.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.42,0:42:47.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,快离开,快离开
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.90,0:43:28.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,别放手
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.74,0:43:41.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走啊 - 快跑,跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.66,0:44:00.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要啊,强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.68,0:44:21.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们,你们在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.19,0:44:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,抬高点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.16,0:44:33.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽力的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.46,0:45:07.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.17,0:45:16.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠后站 在你害死人之前
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.11,0:45:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:42.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,那他妈的是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.93,0:45:46.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要调整一下 下一次,我们会准备好的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:49.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一次?没有下一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.07,0:45:53.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不可能单独处理好这件事 这就是为什么我要找人帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.61,0:45:57.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军,你投入更多的兵力 就让更多无辜的人身处险境
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.82,0:45:59.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会比你造成的多
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.12,0:46:06.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.02,0:46:10.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?你怕鬼吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.66,0:46:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.10,0:46:17.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然你是鬼魂 一定不介意我拧断你的小脖子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.84,0:46:19.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放开他 - 你知道他是谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.90,0:46:22.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特·方·杜姆,是我的部下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.35,0:46:30.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,放开他
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.15,0:46:35.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.19,0:46:39.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,他怎么还活着?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.29,0:46:43.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那当然得多亏了你们四个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.66,0:46:47.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,方·杜姆和外星人有过接触 掌握着有价值的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.87,0:46:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许能拯救地球的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.34,0:46:53.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们先把话说明白
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.50,0:46:56.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吗?我恨你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.84,0:47:00.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们全部
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.38,0:47:06.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,但世界危在旦夕 我们要同心协力才能生存
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.82,0:47:10.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军,我们有亲身体会 你若信任维特,必将后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,目前为止,我后悔信任的人是你,理查斯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德,别答应他们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.14,0:47:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们看看他知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.24,0:47:30.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,对于我们的接触过程 我做了详细的纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.01,0:47:34.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你所认知的都将被终结
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.65,0:47:37.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.02,0:47:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他把你的屁股 摔得稀巴烂那部分
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.19,0:47:48.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看他攻击我时的能量的流动情况
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.03,0:47:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那里,就是那样发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:59.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,能量从他身体流过 但是从源于他的冲浪板
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.24,0:48:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们能把他和冲浪板分开 我们就能完全切断他的能量来源
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.84,0:48:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那就是我们必须做的 - 怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.64,0:48:09.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我知道,还要你们干吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.85,0:48:14.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个现在就应该开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.29,0:48:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴我们有机会再度合作
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.93,0:48:27.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽量说慢点 你好跟得上了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.87,0:48:37.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么可以和维特是一边的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.61,0:48:41.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很无语,兄弟 如果我抽他,事情就会简单得多
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.05,0:48:44.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在干吗?着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.52,0:48:45.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.62,0:48:51.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会赔的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.79,0:48:56.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉你,本 我开始觉得自己是个废物了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.63,0:48:59.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,你不是个废物
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.60,0:49:01.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.33,0:49:05.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧啊,伙计,现在不是我们说了算了 现在取决于理论家们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.77,0:49:10.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得里德是对的吗? 关于世界末日的事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.24,0:49:13.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,他对这种事从来没错过
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.81,0:49:16.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道的,我不是那种懂科技的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.81,0:49:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.98,0:49:22.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果里德是对的,这就是末日了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.92,0:49:28.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你生命的最后几分钟打算怎么过?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.99,0:49:31.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,部分的我想出去打架
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:36.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,但事实上…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.37,0:49:39.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想与艾莉莎相拥度过生命中的最后时光
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.17,0:49:44.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,听上去很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.44,0:49:47.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的不是说抱着艾莉莎的事情 你的女朋友,不是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.11,0:49:51.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想对她干什么 不是说她没有吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.28,0:49:54.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,她非常迷人 她,你知道的,太迷人了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.89,0:49:59.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算(失明),你知道的 想像不到哪一个男人不想…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.69,0:50:02.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.03,0:50:05.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,能和一个人在一起真好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.76,0:50:10.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,我无语了,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.28,0:50:27.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,进展如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.82,0:50:29.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.05,0:50:32.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 会没事的,你拥有所有... - 不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.52,0:50:36.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,整个世界都指望着我呢 而我却…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.39,0:50:38.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德,你会找到答案的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.16,0:50:40.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你总能找到 - 是啊,谢谢,苏
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.93,0:50:42.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你需要休息放松. - 是啊,说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.90,0:50:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,是真的,里德,你需要放松
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.40,0:50:49.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.24,0:50:52.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢慢的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:54.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,做的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.31,0:50:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊,再做一次
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.45,0:51:04.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊,我已经能感觉到你脉搏慢了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.89,0:51:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你记得上次… - 脉冲
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.26,0:51:12.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,速子脉冲
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.60,0:51:15.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.93,0:51:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴我可以帮上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.39,0:51:40.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,这个东西具体怎么工作的?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.62,0:51:44.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们激活他周围的场,这会让他 和冲浪板分开,从而失去能量
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.89,0:51:46.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,就象落网之鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.56,0:51:49.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.43,0:51:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 理论上是,不管怎么说 - 还需要多久可以付之实施
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.80,0:51:55.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 3小时 - 3小时
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.37,0:51:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,我自己一个人 只能做到这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.41,0:52:02.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要实现它,你还需要什么? - 实际上还有几样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.28,0:52:05.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的工程师们有辐射保护服吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.83,0:52:17.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.76,0:52:21.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你有敲门吗? - 你应该在实验室里帮里德
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.83,0:52:23.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉他不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.20,0:52:26.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会去牵着他的小手 帮他完成他的小项目的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.41,0:52:34.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还有别的事吗? - 你怎么做到的?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.81,0:52:38.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么活过来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.99,0:52:43.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,吓着你了,是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.66,0:52:48.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.13,0:52:51.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我能在 人的体内制造一个能量场
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.96,0:52:53.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后让它膨胀直到它爆炸吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.67,0:52:56.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.07,0:53:03.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,快回实验室去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.71,0:53:12.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,史东先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.52,0:53:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们10分钟后开始拦截冲浪手 有没有你都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.22,0:53:21.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才是不是就在浴室门外 等着看我围着浴巾的样子?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.00,0:53:30.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,开玩笑,我开玩笑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.87,0:53:33.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么对我这么冷淡? 你甚至都不了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.20,0:53:37.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上我很了解你 我读过你的个人档案
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.04,0:53:40.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,自负,鲁莽,不负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:42.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,自恋已极
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.58,0:53:45.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,你确实了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.12,0:53:49.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我所看到的就是一个 差点害死自己团队的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.42,0:53:52.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.59,0:53:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最近有点不在状态
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.76,0:53:57.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.59,0:54:11.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,(德国 黑森林)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.74,0:54:14.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 长官,他已经在北面就位 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.28,0:54:17.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 将军,给我一个周长一公里的区域 - 你就别想了,理查斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.38,0:54:20.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你过机会,你搞砸了 现在这是军事行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.82,0:54:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只管扰乱信号 让开路,其它的我们来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.25,0:54:27.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不明白 - 不,是你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.59,0:54:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我把话给你 和你们这帮怪物说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.59,0:54:33.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才是四分卫,而你在我的队伍里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.10,0:54:35.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.30,0:54:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜你高中里从来没打过橄榄球 是吧,理查斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.91,0:54:43.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,你说的对,我没打过橄榄球
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.27,0:54:47.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就像普通的小书呆子一样埋头苦学
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.15,0:54:51.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,然而15年后
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.45,0:54:54.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我成为了21世纪最有智慧的人之一
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.55,0:54:56.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和星球上最性感的女孩订婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.55,0:55:00.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,而高中打橄榄球四分卫的大个子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.66,0:55:03.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他站在我面前,请求我的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.29,0:55:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我告诉他 他妈的什么也别想得到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.66,0:55:10.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非他完全照我说的去做
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.50,0:55:14.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且开始学会如何尊重我和我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.35,0:55:25.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要什么就给他
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.48,0:55:29.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在觉得你性感极了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.65,0:55:32.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得,是不是,里德
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.37,0:55:46.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.24,0:55:51.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有各自的坐标 安置好你们的脉冲仪,然后回来汇合
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.92,0:56:05.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一小队,前进
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.59,0:56:42.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你吓到我了,小灰 看看你,长得真可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.90,0:56:52.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就对了,不要停,布布
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.24,0:56:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不中用的大毛球
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.57,0:57:00.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的情况怎么样? - 很好,我快好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.31,0:57:02.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.06,0:57:15.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:18.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们有麻烦了 - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.46,0:57:19.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.40,0:57:23.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,快离开,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.96,0:57:47.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要毁灭我们的星球?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.73,0:57:51.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.96,0:57:53.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 苏 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.03,0:57:59.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说你别无选择是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.47,0:58:01.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,总有别的选择的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.84,0:58:04.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,不总是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.14,0:58:08.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么想毁灭我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.95,0:58:11.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是毁灭者
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.65,0:58:15.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点啊,理查斯 他妈的快扰乱信号啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.52,0:58:18.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许需要催催他
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.52,0:58:21.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 发射一枚导弹 - 收到,开火
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.47,0:58:37.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 开火 - 开火
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.81,0:58:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,开火,重复,开火
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.55,0:58:50.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,后撤,后撤
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.52,0:58:55.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让我… - 不,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.19,0:58:58.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.66,0:59:00.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点啊,苏
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.43,0:59:04.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,启动了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.43,0:59:06.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.67,0:59:07.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,逮住他了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.13,0:59:36.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,看你再牛逼
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.08,0:59:47.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.98,0:59:49.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是四分卫
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.43,1:00:09.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着点,保持待机
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.47,1:00:12.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 防区安全 - 带他走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.30,1:00:16.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,(西伯利亚 雅库茨克)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.98,1:00:21.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 开门 - 把他带到审讯室
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.82,1:00:36.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 将军,我们有协议的 - 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.63,1:00:38.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,敌人被抓住了,任务完成了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.50,1:00:40.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他在哪? - 关起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.13,1:00:42.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:45.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,沙曼先生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.04,1:00:50.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,失陪了,我们有事情要做
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.54,1:00:53.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我想参加审讯 - 恐怕不行
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.98,1:00:57.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,请保证我们的客人呆在这里 舒舒服服的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.71,1:00:58.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,遵命,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.32,1:01:03.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军,冲浪板怎么处理?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.42,1:01:07.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,它在一间不停放出干扰信号的房间里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.74,1:01:27.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些事不允许我做
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.44,1:01:30.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,出于他们对倾犯人权的顾虑
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.25,1:01:33.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸运的是,你不是人类
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.82,1:01:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是囚犯吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.69,1:01:44.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.19,1:01:47.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,很明显,他们不希望我们 干涉他们的审讯手段
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.40,1:01:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都不敢想像他们会对他做出什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:52.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我说他罪有应得 - 你怎么可以那么说?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.10,1:01:55.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是说,将军说的有可能是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.07,1:01:59.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就是要毁灭地球的 他自己这么说的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.34,1:02:04.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是没有道理啊,他保护我不被导弹伤害 他为什么要那么做?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.21,1:02:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许他觉得你很可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.18,1:02:09.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有别的,他说他不是毁灭者
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.29,1:02:10.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许他在说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.79,1:02:17.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要进去和他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.53,1:02:20.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,但不能被发现
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.57,1:02:27.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,能不能给我们弄个DVD
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.00,1:02:29.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,能不能给我们弄个DVD
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.07,1:02:31.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我会搞定的,史东先生 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.87,1:02:33.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,水兵
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.94,1:02:36.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是海军的叫法,我们是陆军
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.81,1:02:39.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,对啊,我明白了,陆军
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.02,1:02:48.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷上尉,准许进入
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.94,1:03:05.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.61,1:03:08.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,方·杜姆想和你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.58,1:03:11.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你实在应该更合作一些
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.15,1:03:14.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,沙曼先生,我们休息一下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.87,1:03:34.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.12,1:03:48.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.89,1:03:52.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,你一定有名字的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.72,1:03:55.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫苏珊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:05.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说你不是想摧毁我们星球的人 那又是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.20,1:04:07.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的主人 - 你的主人是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.84,1:04:15.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,我在尽量帮助你 但要那样做,你必须告诉我真相
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.85,1:04:17.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.56,1:04:32.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,它有很多名字,我的人民管它叫…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.06,1:04:35.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,加拉特斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.23,1:04:36.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界的毁灭者
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.70,1:04:44.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,它必须吞噬能量才能生存
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.57,1:04:45.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,包括热能
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.71,1:04:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,电能和有机物
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.01,1:04:49.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么能侍奉这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.71,1:04:51.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.38,1:04:55.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能心安理得吗, 所有那些世界 那些无辜的人,你都是帮凶啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.25,1:05:00.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的侍奉,可以让我的世界幸免遇难
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.69,1:05:02.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有我的爱人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.29,1:05:07.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么试图保护我?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.03,1:05:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.53,1:05:15.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你让我想起了她
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.19,1:05:31.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你愿意 你能阻止那个毁灭者吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.59,1:05:35.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是我把毁灭者带到这里的 是灯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.76,1:05:37.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,灯塔是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.49,1:05:39.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能量的来源
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.80,1:05:40.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的冲浪板?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,享受你生命中最后的几个小时吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.34,1:05:51.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为大难已临头
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.52,1:06:12.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,我已经履行我的承诺 帮你们抓住了外星人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.43,1:06:15.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在该你履行承诺了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.27,1:06:18.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以拿冲浪板做实验
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.84,1:06:23.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是要守卫看着,而且我必须在场
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.84,1:06:26.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.85,1:06:35.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈格将军,准许进入
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.08,1:07:00.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,冲浪板正指引着它来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.58,1:07:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么能和吞噬星球的东西对抗呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.71,1:07:05.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到冲浪板 把它引向别的地方,趁现在还来得及
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:08.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,你觉得将军会同意吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.85,1:07:10.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,他没的选择
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.66,1:07:15.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,将军
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.89,1:07:17.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我恐怕…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.19,1:07:19.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,真相是…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.20,1:07:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时里德是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.34,1:07:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.35,1:07:42.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,你过来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.89,1:07:44.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有事要问你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.02,1:08:48.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,棒极了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.82,1:08:54.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.43,1:09:02.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,本
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.97,1:09:08.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,真疼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:12.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 里德在哪里? - 在后面
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.32,1:09:24.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.86,1:09:34.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.53,1:09:41.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特…我们要把他抓回来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.67,1:09:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要带上冲浪手 他是唯一懂得如何运用冲浪板能量的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.54,1:09:48.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,即使我们把他带出这里 怎么才能追上维特?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.95,1:09:51.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就交给我了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.11,1:10:23.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 呆在那不许动
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.85,1:10:30.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,老兄,你行大运了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.29,1:10:36.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里到底发生了什么,哈格将军呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.76,1:10:37.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他死了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.19,1:10:40.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们不带他出去,我们都会死
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.03,1:10:42.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰其…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.70,1:10:48.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界已经危在旦夕了 你必须相信我们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.74,1:10:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.21,1:10:57.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要到屋顶上去,它现在应该到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.15,1:11:00.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.46,1:11:11.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.63,1:11:13.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.40,1:11:16.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是目前为止你做的最酷的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.94,1:11:27.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 半自动的? - 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.98,1:11:31.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,本你进去 强尼,你飞在我们后面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.85,1:11:35.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你得让我驾驶这玩意 - 别想了,我是最好的飞行员,我来开
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.42,1:11:37.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 - 你说真的吗?这东西能装下你已经是运气了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.65,1:11:39.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能开着围着你兜圈子 - 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.09,1:11:43.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 里德 - 闭嘴,快上去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.36,1:11:45.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来开
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.06,1:11:49.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,点火
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.31,1:12:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,我们现在正式成为美国公敌了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.08,1:12:03.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特在某个地方,拥有无限的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.98,1:12:06.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还有个强大的星系怪兽
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.78,1:12:11.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,想在不到24小时里摧毁我们的星球 我漏了什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.39,1:12:15.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经锁定了维特的能量轨迹 他正飞往中国东南部
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.13,1:12:17.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐稳了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.80,1:12:23.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,诺林·拉德
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.13,1:12:29.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 我以前的名字叫诺林·拉德
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.37,1:12:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,诺林,我们需要你帮助我们 来拯救我们的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.51,1:12:35.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.75,1:12:42.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是他妈是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.19,1:12:48.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特,这个冲浪板正引导着毁灭者来这里 你必须放弃它
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.82,1:12:51.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道 我从来都不是会放弃的人,里德
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.56,1:12:53.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓稳了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.44,1:13:08.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是瓮中之鳖
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.91,1:13:10.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须分开
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.68,1:13:12.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 那会很有趣的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.61,1:13:43.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,他把我逼急了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.39,1:13:52.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,大浪来了,金属脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.29,1:13:59.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特,只有冲浪手才能阻止毁灭者 但他需要冲浪板
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.43,1:14:02.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 自己来拿啊,理查斯 - 维特
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.64,1:14:10.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们转起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.55,1:14:51.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,诺林
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.25,1:14:54.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.86,1:15:10.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.40,1:15:16.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.07,1:15:18.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,苏
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.87,1:15:21.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 噢,老天啊 - 强尼,别碰她
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.01,1:15:26.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,天啊,哦,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.48,1:15:28.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要想办法弄到冲浪板
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.72,1:15:31.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 苏,我… - 行
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.53,1:15:40.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,他到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.04,1:15:50.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.54,1:15:52.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,里德
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.41,1:15:58.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,维特一定是通过脉冲发射器 和冲浪板连接的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.21,1:16:01.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们把发射器破坏 就可以把他和冲浪板分开
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.88,1:16:03.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,他对我来说太强大了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.32,1:16:05.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能打败他,如果我可以靠近点的话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.45,1:16:08.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是他能从一公里外看到我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.63,1:16:11.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就我们就一起上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.13,1:16:14.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们中的一个就够了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.37,1:16:21.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不知道这会对你产生什么影响
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.64,1:16:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在不是担心我的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.76,1:16:48.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,用我一个朋友的话说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.06,1:16:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,狂欢时间到了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.36,1:17:49.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能独自战斗,小家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.16,1:17:52.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,没我可不行
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.33,1:19:32.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.59,1:20:05.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍惜和她在一起的每一刻.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.56,1:20:07.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉她,她是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.36,1:20:11.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们确实可以选择
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.99,1:20:39.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你可能需要我帮你一把
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.33,1:20:45.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.66,1:21:17.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么不起作用?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.73,1:21:20.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.14,1:21:31.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不再侍奉你了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.38,1:21:38.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们将同归于尽
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.80,1:23:01.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.87,1:23:05.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.48,1:23:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我错过什么了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.19,1:23:21.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.12,1:23:25.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他做到了 - 干得好,小家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.66,1:23:29.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我不会变化了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.63,1:23:32.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.20,1:23:34.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.64,1:23:38.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,你让我感到不习惯了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.39,1:23:59.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么我想一切都结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.20,1:24:02.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该各走各的了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.06,1:24:04.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.33,1:24:06.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗? - 不是
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.17,1:24:08.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不会吗? - 如果不是整个队伍…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.80,1:24:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,整个世界现在就不复存在了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.57,1:24:14.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能逃避责任,离开需要 我们保护的人,我们为此而生
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.11,1:24:18.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我一直是这么说的 - 你不是想过普通人的生活?组织家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.38,1:24:20.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 组成家庭 - 谁说一定要成为普通人…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.75,1:24:22.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,才可以建立家庭的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.72,1:24:28.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么你准备再办一个马戏媒体团婚礼 第五次,也算个吉利数了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.72,1:24:30.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.59,1:24:34.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有个更好的主意
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.74,1:24:50.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友们,我们今天聚集于此 庆贺里德·理查斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.88,1:24:54.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,和苏·史东的…神圣的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.25,1:24:56.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚姻
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.99,1:24:59.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 威尼斯快要沉入了亚德里亚那海了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.12,1:25:01.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,伙计们,那可是大事件
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.12,1:25:04.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能不能跳到最后?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.79,1:25:08.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好的,希望这对爱人分享… - 不是,是最最后…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.56,1:25:11.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,好极了,戒指带来了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.87,1:25:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.08,1:25:24.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在宣布你们正式成为夫妇 你可以亲吻新娘了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.39,1:25:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧,我们该走了 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.16,1:25:36.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要走了,亲爱的 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.76,1:25:42.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还要抛鲜花呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.13,1:25:44.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.71,1:25:55.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,抬头看,强尼
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.29,1:26:08.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.22,1:26:10.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,条件反射
